// TenantApp.jsx) — an admin session never needs the POS/invoices/etc code
// and vice versa. Code below is unchanged from App.jsx; only the
// imports/constants/small duplicated primitives at the top were added so
// this file is standalone. `Toggle`/`useKeydown`/`modalStack` are a
// deliberate small duplication of what TenantApp.jsx also defines — cheap
// (a few dozen lines) and avoids a third shared chunk for markup this
// trivial. See PROJECT_REFERENCE.md for the split rationale.
